Everything in this directory is GENERATED from content/user-groups/*.yml by the
Astro build (`npm run build`, see astro.config.mjs).

DO NOT EDIT THESE FILES. Edit the YAML record instead and run `npm run build`;
the CI job .github/workflows/build-user-group-pages.yml fails if what is
committed here disagrees with a fresh build, so a hand edit will be caught.

These files are committed because the deployment pipeline syncs this repository
to S3 verbatim and has no build step of its own. See docs/deployment.md.
